# Environment Variable Configuration Template
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to '.env' in this project directory: cp .env.example .env
# 2. Replace the placeholder values below with your own valid values.
# 3. NEVER commit your actual '.env' file or any real secrets to Git.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Demo application (fixtures/demo-app) ---
# PORT=4000

# --- Browser runtime ---
# Point to a pre-installed Chromium binary instead of the one `npx playwright
# install chromium` downloads (useful in CI images/sandboxes with a browser
# already baked in, or restricted network egress).
# PLAYWRIGHT_CHROMIUM_PATH=/opt/pw-browsers/chromium

# --- Security / target policy ---
# Deterministic test execution (src/runner, src/assertions) needs no API key.
# Set this to explicitly opt in to testing loopback/private-network targets
# (e.g. a local dev server). Leave unset in any shared or production context.
# QA_ALLOW_LOCAL_DEV=true

# --- Optional AI planner / diagnosis (not implemented yet, see README roadmap) ---
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
